text.section:
Subsection A shall not be construed to render void any provision of a public construction contract that:

Allows a public body to recover that portion of delay costs caused by the acts or omissions of the contractor, or its subcontractors, agents or employees;


Requires notice of any delay by the party claiming the delay;


Provides for liquidated damages for delay; or


Provides for arbitration or any other procedure designed to settle contract disputes.
